id: SCA-051
title: Dockerfile multi-stage copying root directory
category: supply-chain
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  filenames: Dockerfile
  extensions: .dockerfile
  exclude_paths: test/ node_modules/ .git/ vendor/
  content_contains: COPY --from
patterns:
  - regex: COPY\s+--from=\S+\s+/\s+/
    message: Copying entire root from a build stage that may have had secrets can leak secret files into the final image.
fix: Copy only specific files/directories needed from build stages. Never copy root (/) from a build stage.
